a("|---|---|---|---|---|---|")
for r in R:
    a(f"| {r['A']} v {r['B']} | {pc(r['p_sim_win'])} | {pc(r['p3'])} / {pc(r['p3_alt'])} | {pc(r['straight_fav'])} | {r['tot_mean']:.1f} / {r['tot_median']:.0f} | {r['tot_mean_alt']:.1f} |")
a("")
a("**P(total games OVER line)** - base model (sigma for 38% three-set rate); in brackets the sensitivity run (about 35% three-set rate). Distribution is bimodal (straight sets about 18-23, three sets about 27-35), so P(over 23.5) and P(over 24.5) are nearly equal.")
a("")
