a("")
a("**Totals lines a full game or more off the model median:** only Zverev-Halys. Line 20.5 ([Stats Zone](https://www.thestatszone.com/alexander-zverev-vs-quentin-halys-preview-prediction-2026-shanghai-masters-third-round-229401) tips Over 20.5) vs model median 22 (mean 23.4): P(over 20.5) = " + pc(R[0]['over']['20.5']) + f" base / {pc(R[0]['over_alt']['20.5'])} at a 35% three-set rate; blended edge at -110 = {R[0]['tot_over_edge_110']*100:+.1f}% (base), negative in the sensitivity run. **Not a bet.** Khachanov-Mannarino 22.5 vs median 23 and Hurkacz-Zhou 21.5 vs median 22 are within half a game. ats.io's 'projected totals' (20, 20, 23 games) are modal straight-set scores, not medians, and its UNDER leans (22.5 and 21.5) are not supported by this model (Khachanov-Mannarino P(over 22.5) = " + pc(R[5]['over']['22.5']) + ", Hurkacz-Zhou P(over 21.5) = " + pc(R[6]['over']['21.5']) + ").")
a("")
a("| Total-games leg | Line | P_model(over) base / alt | Over p_blend | Over edge @-110 | Under p_blend | Under edge @-110 |")
a("|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|")
for r in R:
    if r["total_line"]:
        a(f"| {r['A']} v {r['B']} | {r['total_line']} | {pc(r['tot_pover'])} / {pc(r['tot_pover_alt'])} | {pc(r['tot_over_blend'])} | {r['tot_over_edge_110']*100:+.1f}% | {pc(r['tot_under_blend'])} | {r['tot_under_edge_110']*100:+.1f}% |")
c = [r for r in R if r["id"] == "CER-MEN"][0]
a("")
a(f"Cerundolo-Mensik 'Over 2.5 sets' at +110 (Caesars, per Sportytrader): model P(3 sets) = {pc(c['p3'])} (alt {pc(c['p3_alt'])}); blended with the vig-inclusive 47.6% implied = {pc(c['sets_over25_blend'])} vs 47.6% break-even -> edge {c['sets_over25_edge']*100:+.1f}%. No bet.")
a("")
a("**Dabble/Underdog pick'em legs clearing the thresholds:** none identifiable. No pick'em lines were found, and no total-games leg has a blended probability above 52.8% (needs 55.0% for a 3-pick, 57.7% for a 2-pick). Using the lookup table above: a 'More' leg needs raw model p >= 66.7% (3-pick) or 75.7% (2-pick); the few cells that exceed 66.7% (e.g. Halys More 7.5 = " + pc(R[0]['gb_over']['7.5'],0) + ", Gea More 8.5 = " + pc(R[1]['gb_over']['8.5'],0) + ") sit well below the medians, where a pick'em book would not post the line, so they are not actionable.")
a("")
a("**Bottom line:** the market and the blended model agree within about 5 points on every match; after vig there is no moneyline or total with a robust positive edge. The three flagged underdog prices are the only positive-EV candidates and each depends on a price I could not verify and on matches that may already be over.")
