a(f"- Win-probability calibration: max |simulated win prob - target p_blend| across 7 matches = {max(abs(r['p_sim_win']-r['p_blend']) for r in R)*100:.2f} points (MC standard error about 0.08 points).")
a(f"- Three-set rate: tour-like mix = {pc(T['mix']['p3'])} (target 38%); even-match iid check (sigma=0) = 50.2% vs theoretical 50%; 7-match slate average = {pc(sum(r['p3'] for r in R)/7)} (alt {pc(sum(r['p3_alt'] for r in R)/7)}), higher because several matches are near coin-flips.")
